<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地日光.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>What is that sound...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly a <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ごうおん">roar</STYLE> loud enough to burst my eardrums echoed across the whole area.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I scrambled to my feet and went out of the secret base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked all around to find the cause of this abnormal sound, but the dazzling sunlight stung my eyes, which had gotten used to the dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I shaded my eyes from the sun with my hand, my surroundings came into view little by little.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My eyes gradually adjusted, and the scenery leapt into view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't believe it was real.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\荒田枯れ木夏.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The trees... are withered...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I came through here a little while ago, lots of trees had been covered in fine leaves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in just 10 minutes or so, the leaves had fallen and the trees had withered, as if this were a wasteland.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The noisy evening cicadas and the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ごうおん">roar</STYLE> from before had both vanished before I knew it, and all that sounded around me was a faint wind and my own breathing.<PG>
What's going on...? What's happening!?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I hurried, running toward the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Brown, dried-out leaves were piled up underfoot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Crunching them loudly with every step, I ran to the settlement.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wha...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was there at the Niimura main house. It was―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\新村家桜赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Cherry blossoms far too <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="まがまが">ominous</STYLE> to be called beautiful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cherry tree, which should have been dying, flaunted an out-of-season blooming.<PG>
Out-of-season blooming―
{PAUSE ""}
it's a season word for winter in haiku, the phenomenon where, during a run of Indian-summer days, the cherry trees mistake it for the arrival of spring and put out blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But out-of-season blooming in summer, calling it merely <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="まれ">rare</STYLE> would be far too...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this cherry tree really a cherry tree?<PG>
The possibility crossed my mind, but―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
A presence strong enough to blow that away, right behind me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone was behind me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone was in the Arata settlement, which should have been deserted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who came drifting in along with these cherry blossoms?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'re </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, aren't you? I hear you took such good care of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> while she was alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Th-that's... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">impossible...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Congratulations, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> are qualified to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="しんし">a divine messenger</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't believe in the supernatural or in ghosts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything is possible, it is only that scientific phenomena which call those things to mind make people think they are supernatural.<PG>
Then what is this in front of me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A corpse is moving?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this person <STYLE ID="5">Sakura Niimura-san</STYLE>, whom I once saw in a photo?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are you telling me... me, of all people, to accept that?<PG>
But surely, to <STYLE ID="5">her</STYLE>, that doesn't matter at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will be used as a <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しんし">divine messenger</STYLE> for <STYLE ID="5">their</STYLE> purposes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There is no escaping anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because... 
{PAUSE ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
I'm already surrounded by a crowd.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "エンド画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\lcm\ルートエンド.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
